  fhir:CodeSystem.description [ fhir:value "The predicates of the L3 layer. An edge's `predicate` is one of these; which (source, target) pairs each licenses is the layer's edge table. Source: smart-base/L1/schemas/L3.ts (migrated from smart-kg ontology/L3/L3.json)."] ;
