     fhir:CodeSystem.concept.definition [ fhir:value "An L2 component is implemented by a FHIR artefact. Reused from l1 and licensed here per (component, resource) pair transcribed from the published mapping table. ALWAYS `inferred`, never `derived`: with no back-pointer extension in the estate, the join is a naming convention or a canonical reference, and every instance records which rule matched and a resolutionStatus. The optional `targetPath` property on an instance names the element reached (e.g. `PlanDefinition.action[2]`) so traceability can be element-level without this layer modelling FHIR internals as nodes." ]
